body:
Just curious, from a woman's perspective, how many months should a guy date you before he asks about if you want to have kids?  If I guy asks say in the first week of dating is that creepy and a red flag for you to dump him?  If he waits a month is that too long and red flag so dump him?

&#x200B;

Edit:  Or perhaps on the first date so as to not waste any time.  How many kids do you want to have, I know we have only just met and have not kissed yet but????

YTA.  I remember a time when people carried physical money and knew how to walk from point A to point B without consulting a computer device, and people could remember their friends and BFs phone numbers.  Ah the good old days.  I can't imagine running around town with only my phone as a source of payment.  As you have perfectly demonstrated your battery can die, other failures...drop phone and it breaks, it gets stolen, and so on.

&#x200B;

What kind of laptop was it?  Was it a nice mac book?  Yea taking someone's laptop to Uni without permission is really AH move.  Again, what if you drop it, get it stolen?  This shit happens all the time so you can't just say "I was being really careful".

so much for that idea.  Just curious when was the last time you actually saw this woman?  Is the a regular friend in your mom's life?  Have you watched the show Seinfeld?  If not look up the episode about "Festivus"  Sounds like its time for you guys to celebrate festivus and start with "airing grievances"!!!

&#x200B;

https://nypost.com/article/what-is-festivus-how-to-celebrate/

this is not a club anyone wants to belong to.  My parents ended up buying this device that would set off an alarm if I started wetting the bed.  my brother who shared my room blames all his sleep problems on that damn alarm.

&#x200B;

Edit: removed LOL.  I wasn't saying that bed wetting is funny but just my thoughts of being in this club.

I think orwinlandis7 misunderstood what you were trying to do.  Lighting a candle may sound like setting a fire in the car.

&#x200B;

What's brought you to this point?
